      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28529001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "叮叮当当当——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真恋不是一直想要一个可以安静编曲的小房间吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "可、可是……太贵重了，我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28529005",
              "text": "进去看看吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28529004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "好多商品条形码……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "21354……嗯……这个是「燕麦狂想曲」，67990……「沐浴露夜曲」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "还有「茄子之歌」「葫芦之歌」「圆珠笔之歌」……未来生活的每一组条形码，我都会跟真恋分享。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "未来生活的……每一组吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这么说……是不是太油腻了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这种礼物……是不是太简陋了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "没有的事！数字是最棒的音乐灵感库了……而、而且我也很喜欢、喜欢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28529013",
              "text": "喜欢什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28529012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "……阿，好漂亮的计算器！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "是能弹奏音乐的款式！好怀念的感觉……|101|怎么会知道这个？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真恋果然对按键类产品有着出乎意料的兴趣阿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28529016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "谢谢~新专辑的第一首主打，就用编曲屋的条形码和计算器，来进行谱写吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
